          "=== Weighted Hybrid Recommender (\u03b1=0.5) ===\n\nUser_6 rated: The Matrix(4), Inception(3), The Dark Knight(4), Pulp Fiction(3), Toy Story(3), Finding Nemo(4), \n\nMovie                         CB Score   CF Score     Hybrid\n--------------------------------------------------------------\nInterstellar                      3.78       4.12       3.95\nThe Lion King                     3.56       3.89       3.73\nParasite                          3.23       3.67       3.45\nForrest Gump                      3.12       3.45       3.29\nThe Shawshank Redemption          2.89       3.34       3.12\nThe Godfather                     2.78       3.12       2.95"
        ]
