          "python",
          "=== Switching Hybrid Recommender ===\n\nThreshold: 3 ratings (< 3 \u2192 Content-Based, >= 3 \u2192 Collaborative)\n\nUser      Ratings Model Used       Pred Item_5\n-----------------------------------------------\nUser_0          1 Content-Based          2.34\nUser_1          2 Content-Based          2.56\nUser_2          3 Collaborative          3.89\nUser_3          5 Collaborative          4.12\n\n--- Strategy Logic ---\nCold users (< 3 ratings): Content-based is more reliable\nWarm users (>= 3 ratings): Collaborative filtering leverages community data"
